  "description": "## What's New in v4.2.0\n\n### New Model: Claude Sonnet 4.6\n- Added ClaudeSonnet4_6 (claude-sonnet-4-6) with 64K max output tokens\n- Extended thinking supported (Sonnet 4+)\n\n### Deprecated Claude 3.x Models Removed (Breaking Change)\nAll Claude 3.x models have been retired by Anthropic and are removed:\n- Claude3_7SonnetLatest (claude-3-7-sonnet-latest) - use ClaudeSonnet4_250514\n- Claude3_5Haiku241022 (claude-3-5-haiku-20241022) - use ClaudeHaiku4_5_251001\n- Claude3Opus240229 (claude-3-opus-20240229) - removed\n- Claude3Haiku240307 (claude-3-haiku-20240307) - use ClaudeHaiku4_5_251001\n\n## Supported Models\n\n### Anthropic Claude\n- Claude Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, Opus 4.1, Opus 4\n- Claude Sonnet 4.6, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 4\n- Claude Haiku 4.5\n\n### OpenAI\n- GPT-5, GPT-5 Mini, GPT-5 Nano, GPT-5 Chat Latest\n- GPT-5.1\n- GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2 Pro\n- o3, o3-pro\n- GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1 Mini, GPT-4.1 Nano\n- GPT-4o, GPT-4o Mini, GPT-4 Vision\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, Flash-Lite\n- Gemini 3 Pro Preview, Flash Preview\n\n### DeepSeek\n- DeepSeek Chat, DeepSeek Reasoner\n\n### Perplexity\n- Sonar, Sonar Pro, Sonar Reasoning\n\n## Documentation\n- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/wiki\n- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/wiki/Advanced-Features\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/wiki/Release-Notes\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia",
